      "notes": [
        "OS6450-10 explicitly printed in front illustration. Non-PoE model; OS6450-P10 is a different model.",
        "Eight non-combo RJ45 ports numbered 1-8, odd ports upper row and even lower. Two combo logical ports 9 and 10 have both copper and SFP sockets. Dedicated SFP 11 and 12 can act as uplinks/stacking.",
        "There are 14 physical network sockets (10 copper plus 4 SFP), with copper/fiber shared on logical ports 9 and 10; ports 11 and 12 are additional dedicated interfaces.",
        "Diagram prints both dedicated SFP captions as STK B (11/STK B and 12/STK B). This apparent source typo is retained in pixels; avoid assigning A/B from this figure alone.",
        "Rear diagram states pre-production chassis omits product/safety/compliance labels; production chassis have labels. No rear network ports shown."
